     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>One whole step up or down is two keys up or down. Black and white keys count the same.</p>\n<p>Two keys up from E is F#. (Alternative answer: G♭)</p>\n<p>Two keys down from E is D.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "up F<sup>#</sup>, down D"
    }
   ],
